{"id":"prepositions-0092","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 92","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Advertising has a huge influence ___ children.","hint":"influence ___ sb","explanation":"have an influence ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She apologised ___ being so late.","hint":"apologise ___ sth","explanation":"apologise FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The results differ sharply ___ last year\u0027s.","hint":"differ ___ sth","explanation":"differ FROM something (one thing differs from another); differ WITH = disagree."},{"answer":"with","accept":["between"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She has a good relationship ___ her students.","hint":"relationship ___ sb","explanation":"a relationship WITH somebody (BETWEEN two parties)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was found guilty ___ fraud.","hint":"guilty ___ sth","explanation":"guilty OF a crime."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Staff must always be polite ___ customers.","hint":"polite ___ sb","explanation":"polite TO somebody."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The novel was translated ___ twelve languages.","hint":"translate ___ a language","explanation":"translate FROM one language INTO another."},{"answer":"to","accept":["towards"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"His attitude ___ work has really improved.","hint":"attitude ___ sth","explanation":"attitude TO (or TOWARDS) something."}]}